<div id="@_d.I.ClassName" style="display: contents">
    <main id="main"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow"><a href="/jbhl">HOME</a> / HOME LOAN OPTIONS</p><h1>A home loan that still fits your life.</h1><p class="hero-lead">Explore a different rate, repayment structure or loan features with support from a familiar team.</p><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Review your current loan <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="page-hero-image" role="img" aria-label="Australian home in a landscaped garden"></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap content-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT TO CONSIDER</p><h2>Refinance your home loan: start with your situation.</h2><p>There is no single loan structure that suits everyone. We will talk through what you want to achieve, how a loan could fit your budget and what you should understand before applying.</p></div><div class="detail-rows"><div class="detail-row"><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with what you have</h3><p>We look at your current balance, rate, repayments, features and any costs of leaving your loan.</p></div></div><div class="detail-row"><span>02</span><div><h3>Decide what matters now</h3><p>Your goals might be more manageable repayments, a different loan structure, or access to features you actually use.</p></div></div><div class="detail-row"><span>03</span><div><h3>Compare the full picture</h3><p>We help you consider available options, including fees, the loan term and the total amount payable—not only the advertised rate.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="faq-section section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>A few things worth knowing.</h2></div><div class="faqs"><details><summary>When might refinancing make sense?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>When your circumstances or goals have changed, or your current loan may no longer be suitable. A comparison should account for discharge and establishment costs, ongoing fees and any change to the loan term.</p></details><details><summary>Will a lower repayment save me money overall?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Not necessarily. Extending a loan can lower regular repayments while increasing total interest. We will help you compare the overall cost.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A conversation can be a good start</p><h2>Let’s talk about your next step</h2><p>Tell us what you are hoping to do. Our team can help you understand the next step.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="tel:1300795775" class="text-link light">Or call 1300 795 775</a></div></div></section></main>
</div>
